            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Daudi yaalagira abakungu boonaboona mu Isiraeli okwesoloza. Kale bano beesololeza e Yerusalemu: abakulu b'ebika, n'abakulira ebikunsu ebyagheerezanga kyabazinga, n'abaduumizi b'abaisirukale olukumi olukumi n'ekikumi ekikumi, n'abaalabiriranga ebintu n'ebyayo bya kyabazinga ni batabane be, ghalala n'abakungu b'omu kisaagaati kya kyabazinga, era n'abaisirukale boonaboona ab'amaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
