            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Byom 17:1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Agho kyabazinga Daudi yaayemerera, yaakoba ati: “Muwulire bye nkoba, imwe baganda bange era bantu bange. Nayenda inho okuzimbira Esanduuku y'Endagaano ya Musengwa Katonda endhu mw'enaabanga, kibenga ekifo Katonda waife mw'afugira. Era nali ntegeike okuzimba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aye Katonda yankoba ati, ‘Busa, otanzimbira isinzizo, kuba iwe oli mulwani wa ntalo era wayugha omusaayi gw'abantu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ate mu b'oku nda ya lata wange boonaboona, Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli ninze ye yalondamu okuba kyabazinga wa Isiraeli oyo ebyanda n'ebyanda. Mu nda edh'abaasimuka mu Yuda, yalondamu enda ya lata wange. Ate mu baana ba lata wange, yaasiimamu nze okunfuula kyabazinga wa Isiraeli yoonayoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda oyo yampa abaana kamaala era mu batabane bange boonaboona, yaalondamu Solomoni okutyama ku kityamo eky'obwakyabazinga bwa Isiraeli, Musengwa Katonda mwene oyo bwe yataagho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Musengwa Katonda yankoba ati, ‘Mutabane wo Solomoni n'alinzimbira eisinzizo ghalala n'empya dhange, kuba namulonda abe mutabane wange, nze mbe lata we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidha kuleeteranga obwakyabazinga bwe okukakata ebyanda n'ebyanda, bw'anaafubanga okugondera amateeka gange n'ebiragiro byange nga bw'ali kukola mpegaano.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kale ni bantu bange, mu maiso g'abantu ba Musengwa Katonda Abaisiraeli abeesoloiza, mbasikirira nga ni Katonda waife awulira, nti: Mwisengayo inho omwoyo okugondera ebiragiro byonabyona ebya Musengwa Katonda waimwe, mughange okusigala nga mukaali beene nsi eno enkalamu, mugirekere abaana baimwe n'abaidhukulu abanaabaiririranga, ebenga yaibwe ebyanda n'ebyanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho yaakoba Solomoni ati: “Era iwe mwana wange Solomoni, manhanga Katonda wange nze lata wo, omugheerezenga n'omwoyo mulala aghazira kusagansagana, kuba Musengwa Katonda oyo ayagaaza yaazuula ebiri mu myoyo gy'abantu era yaategeera bye bategeike okukola byonabyona. Bw'onaamunoonianga, oidha kumuzuulanga. Aye bw'onaamuvangaku, aidhanga kukulekulira agho ebyanda n'ebyanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni ogwaine okimanhe nga Musengwa Katonda akulonze okuzimba endhu ey'okusinzizaamu. Kale omulimo ogwo gukole n'obumalirivu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Daudi yaagha mutabane we Solomoni entegeka ey'enzimba y'eisinzizo nga bw'eja okuba: ekisasi kyaku, n'endhu dhaaku, n'amaterekero gaaku, n'ebisenge byaku ebya ghaigulu, n'ebisenge byaku eby'omunda, n'Ekifo Ekitukuvu Einho ekisoniyirwamu ebibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamugha n'entegeka ey'enzimba y'ebyo byonabyona bye yayenda okuzimbira ku isinzizo eryo: empya dhaaku, n'ebimante ebyezungulwire empya edho, n'amaterekero g'ebintu eby'okukozesanga mu isinzizo, n'ago ag'okutangamu ebintu ebigheereibwayo okuba ebya Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaamugha entegeka yoonayoona ey'engobo dha bakabona n'Abalevi, n'entegeka ey'omulimo gwonagwona ogw'okugheereza mu isinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda, n'ey'ebintu byonabyona eby'okukozesanga mu isinzizo eryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamugha n'obuzito bwa zaabu ni feeza ow'okukolamu ebintu byonabyona ebya zaabu ni feeza eby'okukozesanga ku buli mulimo ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'obuzito bwa zaabu ow'okukolamu buli kikondo kya ntaala ghalala n'entaala dhaaku, nga bajiira ku mirimo ebintu ebyo gye bikola ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'obuzito bwa zaabu ow'okukolamu buli meeza ey'okutangaku emigaati egigheereibwayo eri Katonda, n'obwa feeza ow'okukolamu meeza edha feeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamugha n'obuzito bwa zaabu omukenenule ow'okukolamu ebyuma eby'amaino ng'oti wuuma, n'ow'okukolamu ebibya n'ebikopo n'obuzito bwa zaabu n'obwa feeza ow'okukolamu entamu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'obuzito bwa zaabu omukenenule ow'okukolamu alutaari ey'okuniokezangaku obubbaani, n'ow'okukolamu ekigaali eky'okutaaku ebitonde ebiri n'amaghagha ebyetebwa bikerubi, ebyandhuluza amaghagha gaabyo okughemba Esanduuku y'Endagaano ya Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Daudi yaakoba ati: “Ebyo byonabyona biri mu ntegeka eyaghandiikibwa ng'ejiira ku biragiro ebyo, Musengwa Katonda mwene bye yandagira okutuukiriza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Daudi yaakoba mutabane we Solomoni ati: “Guma omwoyo obe mumalirivu, okole omulimo ogwo. Otatyanga era otawangamu maani, kuba Musengwa Katonda wange ali ghalala n'iwe. Talikuvaaku, waire okukulekulira agho, aidha kubanga ghalala n'iwe akusobozese okumaliriza omulimo gwonagwona ogw'okukola ku isinzizo lye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabona n'Abalevi baabo bamaze okugheebwa emirimo gyonagyona gye banaakolanga mu ngobo mu isinzizo. Abakozi abali n'obumanhirivu obw'okukola kiisi mulimo baligho era beetegefu okukola. N'abakulembeze boona, ghalala n'abantu boonaboona baidha kugonderanga by'onaabalagiranga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
